## 1. 🎰 Daily Spin (Günlük Şans Çarkı)

### Veritabanı
```sql
daily_spin_prizes: id, name, type, value, probability, color, icon, is_jackpot, is_active
user_spins: id, user_id, prize_id, created_at
```

